      "west": "Any",
      "category": "Complex",
      "description": "A park, should have a fence going around it, benches, trees, a path connecting the entrances, etc...\r\n\r\nMake the fence be brown, make the trees be more \u0022random\u0022. They are currently in a perfect grid. add a trashcan and a statue",
