      "name": "Ashgrove Pocket Park",
      "kind": "Complex",
      "summary": "Open urban park with brown perimeter fencing, open north and south gates, connected paved paths, irregularly scattered trees, benches, a trashcan and a box-built statue. Displaced benches, litter, graffiti and a broken statue arm depict outbreak damage while keeping paths clear.",
